{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"host-adapters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Host adapters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Host adapters turn provider-native cron or scheduled function entrypoints into a\nbounded "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime.sweep()"},{"type":"text","value":" call."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"They are intentionally thin. Workflow semantics live in the runtime and store.\nDocumentation and adapter development should prioritize partner environments:\nCloudflare, Railway, and Netlify. Vercel remains an important compatibility\ntarget, but examples should not make it the default host."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-behavior","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common behavior"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current packaged host adapters:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"materializeWorkflowSchedules"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime.sweep"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeEvents"},{"type":"text","value":" to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"return a compact JSON summary"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"optionally include the full sweep result for debugging"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"cloudflare","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/workflow-cloudflare","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createcloudflareworkflowscheduledhandler","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-cloudflare'\n\nexport default {\n  scheduled: createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler({\n    runtime: ({ env }) => createWorkflowRuntime(env),\n    maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n    maxTimers: 25,\n    maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n  }),\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorkflowRuntimeDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":", or a function that creates one from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"controller"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"env"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ctx"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"now"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional timestamp provider. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"controller.scheduledTime"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseOwner"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"String or function for worker identity."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"limit"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxScheduledRuns"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum schedule buckets to start."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxTimers"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum timers to resume."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxDurationMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sweep wall-clock budget."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lease duration."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum retained events per run result."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeSweepResult"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"materializeSchedules"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set false to skip schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cronLookbackMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lookback window for cron schedule materialization."}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configure Cloudflare Cron Triggers directly in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"wrangler.json"},{"type":"text","value":" or\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"wrangler.toml"},{"type":"text","value":". The adapter does not wrap that static platform config."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"railway","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Railway"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/workflow-railway","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createrailwayworkflowcroncommand","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand } from '@tanstack/workflow-railway'\n\nconst sweep = createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n  logSummary: true,\n})\n\nawait sweep()","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorkflowRuntimeDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"now"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional timestamp provider."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseOwner"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"String or function for worker identity."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"limit"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxScheduledRuns"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum schedule buckets to start."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxTimers"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum timers to resume."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxDurationMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sweep wall-clock budget."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lease duration."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum retained events per run result."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeSweepResult"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"materializeSchedules"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set false to skip schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cronLookbackMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lookback window for cron schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"logSummary"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" to log JSON summary, or a function to receive the result."}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configure the Railway Cron Job directly in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"railway.toml"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"railway.json"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"[deploy]\nstartCommand = \"pnpm workflow:sweep\"\ncronSchedule = \"*/5 * * * *\"\nrestartPolicyType = \"NEVER\"","lang":"toml"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"netlify","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Netlify"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/workflow-netlify","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createnetlifyworkflowsweephandler","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-netlify'\n\nexport default createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorkflowRuntimeDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"now"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional timestamp provider."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseOwner"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"String or function for worker identity."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"limit"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxScheduledRuns"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum schedule buckets to start."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxTimers"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum timers to resume."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxDurationMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sweep wall-clock budget."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lease duration."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum retained events per run result."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeSweepResult"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"materializeSchedules"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set false to skip schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cronLookbackMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lookback window for cron schedule materialization."}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Export the Netlify Scheduled Function "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config"},{"type":"text","value":" object directly. Netlify needs\nthat object to be statically visible:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export const config = {\n  schedule: '*/5 * * * *',\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Netlify adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; do not define Workflow's\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"workflow_*"},{"type":"text","value":" tables in application schema files unless you are intentionally\nbuilding typed admin access."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vercel","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vercel"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/workflow-vercel","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createvercelworkflowsweephandler","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-vercel'\n\nexport const GET = createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  cronSecret: process.env.CRON_SECRET,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runtime"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorkflowRuntimeDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"now"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional timestamp provider."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseOwner"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"String or function for worker identity."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"limit"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxScheduledRuns"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum schedule buckets to start."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxTimers"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum timers to resume."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxDurationMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sweep wall-clock budget."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"leaseMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lease duration."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxEvents"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum retained events per run result."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeSweepResult"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"materializeSchedules"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set false to skip schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cronLookbackMs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lookback window for cron schedule materialization."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cronSecret"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Expected "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Authorization: Bearer <secret>"},{"type":"text","value":" value."}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configure Vercel Cron directly in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercel.json"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json\",\n  \"crons\": [{ \"path\": \"/api/workflow/sweep\", \"schedule\": \"*/5 * * * *\" }]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vercel adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; route code owns host config, while\nWorkflow owns the runtime persistence schema."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"response-shape","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Response shape"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Successful adapters return:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"interface SweepResponse {\n  ok: true\n  now: number\n  leaseOwner: string\n  materialized: ReadonlyArray<MaterializedWorkflowSchedule>\n  summary: {\n    materialized: number\n    scheduled: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    timers: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    eventCount: number\n    returnedEventCount: number\n  }\n  deadlineReached: boolean\n  remainingMayExist: boolean\n  sweep?: WorkflowRuntimeSweepResult\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use the summary for normal logs and monitoring. Include the full "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sweep"},{"type":"text","value":" only for\ndebugging."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"re-exported-schedule-helpers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Re-exported schedule helpers"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Both adapters re-export:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"materializeWorkflowSchedules","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"and the related materialization types from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/workflow-runtime"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"host-adapters","text":"Host adapters","level":1},{"id":"common-behavior","text":"Common behavior","level":2},{"id":"cloudflare","text":"Cloudflare","level":2},{"id":"createcloudflareworkflowscheduledhandler","text":"createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler","level":3},{"id":"railway","text":"Railway","level":2},{"id":"createrailwayworkflowcroncommand","text":"createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand","level":3},{"id":"netlify","text":"Netlify","level":2},{"id":"createnetlifyworkflowsweephandler","text":"createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler","level":3},{"id":"vercel","text":"Vercel","level":2},{"id":"createvercelworkflowsweephandler","text":"createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler","level":3},{"id":"response-shape","text":"Response shape","level":2},{"id":"re-exported-schedule-helpers","text":"Re-exported schedule helpers","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Host adapters\n\nHost adapters turn provider-native cron or scheduled function entrypoints into a\nbounded `runtime.sweep()` call.\n\nThey are intentionally thin. Workflow semantics live in the runtime and store.\nDocumentation and adapter development should prioritize partner environments:\nCloudflare, Railway, and Netlify. Vercel remains an important compatibility\ntarget, but examples should not make it the default host.\n\n## Common behavior\n\nCurrent packaged host adapters:\n\n- call `materializeWorkflowSchedules`\n- call `runtime.sweep`\n- default `includeEvents` to `false`\n- return a compact JSON summary\n- optionally include the full sweep result for debugging\n\n## Cloudflare\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-cloudflare\n```\n\n### `createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-cloudflare'\n\nexport default {\n  scheduled: createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler({\n    runtime: ({ env }) => createWorkflowRuntime(env),\n    maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n    maxTimers: 25,\n    maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n  }),\n}\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`, or a function that creates one from `controller`, `env`, and `ctx`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. Defaults to `controller.scheduledTime`. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n\nConfigure Cloudflare Cron Triggers directly in `wrangler.json` or\n`wrangler.toml`. The adapter does not wrap that static platform config.\n\n## Railway\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-railway\n```\n\n### `createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand`\n\n```ts\nimport { createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand } from '@tanstack/workflow-railway'\n\nconst sweep = createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n  logSummary: true,\n})\n\nawait sweep()\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n| `logSummary` | `true` to log JSON summary, or a function to receive the result. |\n\nConfigure the Railway Cron Job directly in `railway.toml` or `railway.json`:\n\n```toml\n[deploy]\nstartCommand = \"pnpm workflow:sweep\"\ncronSchedule = \"*/5 * * * *\"\nrestartPolicyType = \"NEVER\"\n```\n\n## Netlify\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-netlify\n```\n\n### `createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-netlify'\n\nexport default createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n})\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n\nExport the Netlify Scheduled Function `config` object directly. Netlify needs\nthat object to be statically visible:\n\n```ts\nexport const config = {\n  schedule: '*/5 * * * *',\n}\n```\n\nThe Netlify adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; do not define Workflow's\n`workflow_*` tables in application schema files unless you are intentionally\nbuilding typed admin access.\n\n## Vercel\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-vercel\n```\n\n### `createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-vercel'\n\nexport const GET = createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  cronSecret: process.env.CRON_SECRET,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n})\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n| `cronSecret` | Expected `Authorization: Bearer <secret>` value. |\n\nConfigure Vercel Cron directly in `vercel.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json\",\n  \"crons\": [{ \"path\": \"/api/workflow/sweep\", \"schedule\": \"*/5 * * * *\" }]\n}\n```\n\nThe Vercel adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; route code owns host config, while\nWorkflow owns the runtime persistence schema.\n\n## Response shape\n\nSuccessful adapters return:\n\n```ts\ninterface SweepResponse {\n  ok: true\n  now: number\n  leaseOwner: string\n  materialized: ReadonlyArray<MaterializedWorkflowSchedule>\n  summary: {\n    materialized: number\n    scheduled: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    timers: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    eventCount: number\n    returnedEventCount: number\n  }\n  deadlineReached: boolean\n  remainingMayExist: boolean\n  sweep?: WorkflowRuntimeSweepResult\n}\n```\n\nUse the summary for normal logs and monitoring. Include the full `sweep` only for\ndebugging.\n\n## Re-exported schedule helpers\n\nBoth adapters re-export:\n\n```ts\nmaterializeWorkflowSchedules\n```\n\nand the related materialization types from `@tanstack/workflow-runtime`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: host-adapters\ntitle: Host Adapters\n---\n\n# Host adapters\n\nHost adapters turn provider-native cron or scheduled function entrypoints into a\nbounded `runtime.sweep()` call.\n\nThey are intentionally thin. Workflow semantics live in the runtime and store.\nDocumentation and adapter development should prioritize partner environments:\nCloudflare, Railway, and Netlify. Vercel remains an important compatibility\ntarget, but examples should not make it the default host.\n\n## Common behavior\n\nCurrent packaged host adapters:\n\n- call `materializeWorkflowSchedules`\n- call `runtime.sweep`\n- default `includeEvents` to `false`\n- return a compact JSON summary\n- optionally include the full sweep result for debugging\n\n## Cloudflare\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-cloudflare\n```\n\n### `createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-cloudflare'\n\nexport default {\n  scheduled: createCloudflareWorkflowScheduledHandler({\n    runtime: ({ env }) => createWorkflowRuntime(env),\n    maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n    maxTimers: 25,\n    maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n  }),\n}\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`, or a function that creates one from `controller`, `env`, and `ctx`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. Defaults to `controller.scheduledTime`. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n\nConfigure Cloudflare Cron Triggers directly in `wrangler.json` or\n`wrangler.toml`. The adapter does not wrap that static platform config.\n\n## Railway\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-railway\n```\n\n### `createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand`\n\n```ts\nimport { createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand } from '@tanstack/workflow-railway'\n\nconst sweep = createRailwayWorkflowCronCommand({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n  logSummary: true,\n})\n\nawait sweep()\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in the returned object. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n| `logSummary` | `true` to log JSON summary, or a function to receive the result. |\n\nConfigure the Railway Cron Job directly in `railway.toml` or `railway.json`:\n\n```toml\n[deploy]\nstartCommand = \"pnpm workflow:sweep\"\ncronSchedule = \"*/5 * * * *\"\nrestartPolicyType = \"NEVER\"\n```\n\n## Netlify\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-netlify\n```\n\n### `createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-netlify'\n\nexport default createNetlifyWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 25_000,\n})\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n\nExport the Netlify Scheduled Function `config` object directly. Netlify needs\nthat object to be statically visible:\n\n```ts\nexport const config = {\n  schedule: '*/5 * * * *',\n}\n```\n\nThe Netlify adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; do not define Workflow's\n`workflow_*` tables in application schema files unless you are intentionally\nbuilding typed admin access.\n\n## Vercel\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/workflow-vercel\n```\n\n### `createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler`\n\n```ts\nimport { createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler } from '@tanstack/workflow-vercel'\n\nexport const GET = createVercelWorkflowSweepHandler({\n  runtime,\n  cronSecret: process.env.CRON_SECRET,\n  maxScheduledRuns: 25,\n  maxTimers: 25,\n  maxDurationMs: 55_000,\n})\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `runtime` | Required `WorkflowRuntimeDefinition`. |\n| `now` | Optional timestamp provider. |\n| `leaseOwner` | String or function for worker identity. |\n| `limit` | Shared fallback limit for schedules and timers. |\n| `maxScheduledRuns` | Maximum schedule buckets to start. |\n| `maxTimers` | Maximum timers to resume. |\n| `maxDurationMs` | Sweep wall-clock budget. |\n| `leaseMs` | Lease duration. |\n| `includeEvents` | Whether retained run results include events. Defaults to false. |\n| `maxEvents` | Maximum retained events per run result. |\n| `includeSweepResult` | Include full sweep result in JSON response. Defaults to false. |\n| `materializeSchedules` | Set false to skip schedule materialization. |\n| `cronLookbackMs` | Lookback window for cron schedule materialization. |\n| `cronSecret` | Expected `Authorization: Bearer <secret>` value. |\n\nConfigure Vercel Cron directly in `vercel.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json\",\n  \"crons\": [{ \"path\": \"/api/workflow/sweep\", \"schedule\": \"*/5 * * * *\" }]\n}\n```\n\nThe Vercel adapter only wakes the runtime. Apply the store adapter's\npackage-owned migration during deploy/setup; route code owns host config, while\nWorkflow owns the runtime persistence schema.\n\n## Response shape\n\nSuccessful adapters return:\n\n```ts\ninterface SweepResponse {\n  ok: true\n  now: number\n  leaseOwner: string\n  materialized: ReadonlyArray<MaterializedWorkflowSchedule>\n  summary: {\n    materialized: number\n    scheduled: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    timers: Partial<Record<WorkflowRuntimeRunResultKind, number>>\n    eventCount: number\n    returnedEventCount: number\n  }\n  deadlineReached: boolean\n  remainingMayExist: boolean\n  sweep?: WorkflowRuntimeSweepResult\n}\n```\n\nUse the summary for normal logs and monitoring. Include the full `sweep` only for\ndebugging.\n\n## Re-exported schedule helpers\n\nBoth adapters re-export:\n\n```ts\nmaterializeWorkflowSchedules\n```\n\nand the related materialization types from `@tanstack/workflow-runtime`.\n"}
